---

<BaseLayout
  title={`${productName} | 三合一瓶装水灌装线`}
  description="200ML-2L小瓶装水灌装生产线，适用于纯净水、矿泉水和山泉水PET瓶生产，包含技术参数、整线模块和报价配置。"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />

  <article class="product-detail-page product-detail-page--rich product-detail-page--square-hero product-detail-page--compact-title solution-line-page">
    <section class="product-hero product-hero--rich">
      <div class="container product-rich-hero-inner">
        <div class="product-hero-breadcrumb-bar">
          <nav class="product-breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑导航">
            <a href="/">首页</a>
            <span>/</span>
            <a href="/solutions/">解决方案</a>
            <span>/</span>
            <a href="/products/filling-machine/water-filling-machine/">水灌装机</a>
          </nav>
        </div>

        <div class="product-hero-heading">
          <h1>{productName}</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="product-hero-content">
          <div class="product-hero-showcase">
            <div class="product-hero-gallery" data-product-gallery>
              <div class="product-hero-thumbs" role="tablist" aria-label="200ML-2L水灌装机图片">
                {heroGallery.map((image, index) => (
                  <button
                    class:list={['product-hero-thumb', index === 0 && 'is-active']}
                    type="button"
                    role="tab"
                    aria-selected={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
                    aria-label={`显示 ${image.label}`}
                    data-gallery-thumb
                    data-gallery-index={String(index)}
                    data-gallery-src={image.src}
                    data-gallery-alt={image.alt}
                  >
                    <img src={image.src} alt={`${image.alt} 缩略图`} width="120" height="120" loading={index < 4 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'} decoding="async" />
                  </button>
                ))}
              </div>
              <div class="product-hero-frame">
                <button class="product-hero-gallery-btn product-hero-gallery-btn--prev" type="button" aria-label="上一张产品图片" data-gallery-prev>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M15 18 9 12l6-6"></path>
                  </svg>
                </button>
                <div class="product-hero-media">
                  <img
                    src={heroGallery[0].src}
                    alt={heroGallery[0].alt}
                    width="960"
                    height="960"
                    loading="eager"
                    decoding="async"
                    data-gallery-main
                  />
                  <div class="product-hero-cert-badges" aria-label="认证标识">
                    <span>CE</span>
                    <span>ISO</span>
                    <span>SGS</span>
                    <span>CNAS</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <button class="product-hero-gallery-btn product-hero-gallery-btn--next" type="button" aria-label="下一张产品图片" data-gallery-next>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path>
                  </svg>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="product-hero-form-card" id="quote">
            <div class="product-hero-intro-card">
              <p class="product-hero-intro-eyebrow">方案概述</p>
              <h2>{productName}</h2>
              <p>
                这条200ML-2L小瓶装水灌装生产线适用于纯净水、矿泉水和山泉水等PET瓶装饮用水项目。整线可包含水处理、吹瓶、三合一冲洗灌装封盖、贴标、喷码、膜包或纸箱包装及输送系统。设备可根据瓶型、目标产能和车间布局配置，适合从起步型水厂到中高速瓶装水生产项目。
              </p>
              <a class="product-hero-phone-button" href="tel:18962223666" aria-label="拨打电话 18962223666">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.3 19.3 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8.1 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.2a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.5c.9.3 1.8.6 2.8.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2Z"></path>
                </svg>
                电话咨询：18962223666
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-section product-summary-strip">
      <div class="container product-summary-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="product-kicker">项目资料</p>
          <h2 class="section-title--secondary">企业实力与整线交付能力</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="product-summary-cards">
          <div><strong>20+</strong><span>年行业经验<small>丰富的设备制造与项目实施经验</small></span></div>
          <div><strong>整线</strong><span>交钥匙方案<small>从方案设计到安装调试一站式服务</small></span></div>
          <div><strong>CE / ISO</strong><span>国际认证<small>严格质量管理，符合国际标准</small></span></div>
          <div><strong>50+</strong><span>国家和地区<small>设备远销全球，提供完善售后支持</small></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-section product-overview product-section--white" id="overview">
      <div class="container product-overview-layout">
        <div class="product-overview-head">
          <div>
            <h2 class="section-title--primary">完整瓶装水灌装生产线方案</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-line-flow-group">
          <figure class="product-layout-figure">
            <img
              src={`${assetBase}/200ml-2l-small-bottle-water-bottling-line-complete-line-layout.webp`}
              alt="从水处理到灌装贴标包装和码垛的完整瓶装水生产线布局"
              width="1710"
              height="805"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </figure>
          <div class="product-process-caption-strip" aria-label="瓶装水生产线流程">
            {processSteps.map(([title, text], index) => (
              <div class="product-process-item">
